entries[389409] = { ["name"] = "Primal Draconium Deposit", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n3.2 sec cast\nDraconium Deposits are a rare find upon the Dragon Isles, but they are more often spotted in rugged or hard to reach locations.\n\nThey are sometimes marked by the primal elements and may reveal additional Rousing Elements beyond what is normally discovered when mining.\n\nMiners specialized in Primal nodes gain the following effect when mining:\n\nExplosive Elements :\nCooldown reduction on Overload increased by 30%. Specialized miners have a chance to deal bonus Elemental damage with their spells and abilities. Lasts 2 min." }
