entries[389459] = { ["name"] = "Molten Serevite Deposit", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n3.2 sec cast\nSerevite is the most common ore found across the Dragon Isles. Though it is often found in mountainous regions, it is also revealed around flowing bodies of water.\n\nThey are sometimes enveloped in flames, particularly in geologically active regions. Its unbearable heat often deters novice miners from harvesting its abundance of Rousing Fire.\n\nMiners specialized in Molten nodes will gain the following effect when mining:\n\nMolten Fury :\nEnvelops you in flame which causes your attackers to suffer 1721 Fire damage. Lasts 2 min." }
entries[389460] = { ["name"] = "Rich Serevite Deposit", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n5.3 sec cast\nSerevite is the most common ore found across the Dragon Isles. Though it is often found in mountainous regions, it is also revealed around flowing bodies of water.\n\nRich deposits are particularly dense with ore, sure to delight any miner to stumble upon one." }
